# config/playlists.txt.example
#
# Copy this file to config/playlists.txt and replace the sample entries below with your own
# SoundCloud/Spotify/YouTube playlist (or "likes") URLs. One URL per line; blank lines and
# `#`-prefixed comment lines (e.g. section headers) are ignored.
# Spotify URLs are downloaded via spotdl (YouTube Music matching), everything else via yt-dlp.

# Example section
https://soundcloud.com/example-user/sets/example-playlist
https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=EXAMPLE_PLAYLIST_ID
https://open.spotify.com/playlist/EXAMPLE_PLAYLIST_ID

# Likes (large)
https://soundcloud.com/example-user/likes
